 "text": "Highland County Recorder\nQUICK LINKS\nVisit\nStatistics\nSchool Districts\nPublic Notices\nForms\nHome\nI Want To...\nGovernment\nServices\nBusiness\nVisitors\nPublic Notices\nForms\nContact\nHighland County Recorder\nChad McConnaughey, Recorder\nEmily Jackson, Chief Deputy Recorder\nEmily Barr, Deputy Recorder\nPhysical Address: 119 Governor Foraker Pl., Ste. 108\nMailing Address: P.O. Box 804 – Hillsboro, Ohio 45133\nPhone (937) 393-9954\nrecorder@co.highland.oh.us\nMonday – Friday, 8:00 AM to 4:00 PM\nCLICK HERE for Records Search\nFRAUD SLEUTH INSTRUCTIONS\nFRAUD SLEUTH STEP-BY-STEP WITH PICTURES\n* MARGINAL NOTATION FEE: $4.00 PER REFERENCE.\n* ALL DOCUMENTS THAT ARE NOTARIZED AFTER JULY 1, 2009 MUST COMPLY WITH THE STATE OF OHIO DOCUMENT STANDARDS OR AN ADDITIONAL $20.00 WILL BE ASSESSED. (PER ORC 317.114)\n* UCC DOCUMENTS ARE $12.00 PER FORM AND $4.00 PER NAME AND MUST INVOLVE REAL ESTATE AND INCLUDE A FULL LEGAL DESCRIPTION.\n* ALL DOCUMENTS THAT WILL BE MAILED BACK AFTER RECORDING MUST HAVE A SELF-ADDRESSED AND STAMPED ENVELOPE PROVIDED.\n** Note: Documents received after 3:30 pm will not be recorded that day, but will be held and ran the following business day.\nADDITIONAL INFORMATION\nConveyance Standards\nRecording Process\nOhio Recorders’ Association\nFREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS\n*** Rates effective January 1, 2025 ***\nPAGES |\nAMOUNT |\n1 OR 2 |\n$39.00 |\n3 |\n$47.00 |\n4 |\n$55.00 |\n5 |\n$63.00 |\n6 |\n$71.00 |\n7 |\n$79.00 |\n8 |\n$87.00 |\n9 |\n$95.00 |\n10 |\n$103.00 |\n** CASH OR CHECK ONLY FOR RECORDINGS - CREDIT CARDS ARE NOT ACCEPTED AT THIS TIME **\n$4.00 Marginal Notation Fee\n**Standardization Guidelines still apply\nAuditor\nClerk of Courts\nCommissioners\nCommon Pleas Court\nCoroner\nCounty Court\nEngineer\nJuvenile Court\nMunicipal Court\nProbate Court\nProsecuter\nRecorder\nSheriff\nTreasurer\nTownship Trustees\n© 2026 Highland County Ohio Commissioners. All rights reserved. Website by Westside Media .",
